      "value": "@{60651324fbe2815d2b9ff6cb|full_name} https://ask.vrchat.com/t/developer-update-31-july-2025/45861\n\n> With that said, there could be some strange edge cases where worlds will fail checks when they shouldn’t. We’ve fixed most of these cases during the ongoing beta, but if you notice strange behavior, you should let us know.",
