      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "The checks have been adjusted so this use case works again, it may take up to a couple weeks for worlds which have failed due to this to be reprocessed. If there's a specific world which is currently failing the checks you want reprocessed sooner post the id here.\n\nChecks like these were added long ago in response to malicious avatars with mesh setups that aren't possible causing issues of various forms (usually crashing). Certain validation is important for any asset bundle as unity doesn't validate everything as much as anyone would like and so it doesn't matter for checks like these if it's an avatar or world.\n\nI appreciate the detail given in the report as well, it helped provide context around the lesser used setups of formats.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
